### OS Files ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### Local Settings ###
# mise's per-machine overrides, such as environment variables for one machine's tasks
mise.local.toml

### Tool Caches ###
.cache
# lychee always writes its cache to the repo root; move it under .cache once a
# release supports configuring that (lycheeverse/lychee#1700)
.lycheecache
# Python run outside mise's environment (e.g. an IDE's test runner) writes its
# bytecode cache next to tests/ and scripts/ instead of under .cache/pycache
__pycache__
